  "releaseNotes": "[2025-06-20] v0.1.5-preview Add MCP functions in XncfRegisterBase class\n        v0.1.0 initial release\n        v0.1.3.4 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2025-07-27] v0.1.6-preview.1 update Knowledge Base\n        [2025-11-01] update basic libraries, including Senparc.AI\n        [2026-01-07] v0.1.9-preview.1 Reset all database migrations\n        [2026-04-24] Simplify FunctionRender request parameters and keep SelectionList UI metadata compatibility\n        [2026-07-17] v0.3.0-preview2 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        1. integrateshared resource-localization mechanism, supportmodulefeature textdisplay dynamically according to the current culture\n        2. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        3. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        4. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        5. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-07-29] v0.3.1-preview3 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        2. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-07-31] v0.4.0-preview4 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        2. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-08-04] v0.5.0-preview5 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        2. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-08-08] v0.5.1-preview6 Dependency updates from upstream projects\n        1. Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.23.2-preview6\n        2. Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.DatabasePlant to 0.21.6-preview6\n        3. Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.Service to 0.23.6-preview6\n        4. Dependency update from Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase to 0.13.4-preview6\n        [2026-08-13] v0.6.0-preview1 refactorfile resourcesboundary\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        2. siteresourceprivate by default, provide a public URL with a SHA-256 fingerprint and long-term caching after explicit publication\n        3. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        4. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-08-15] v0.6.1-preview2 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.DatabasePlant to 0.21.8-preview8; Senparc.Ncf.Service to 0.23.8-preview8\n        [2026-08-22] v0.6.2-preview3 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-08-29] v0.6.3 Dependency updates from Senparc.Ncf.DatabasePlant to 0.21.10; Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.Service to 0.23.9-preview9\n        1. Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.DatabasePlant to 0.21.10\n        2. Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.Service to 0.23.9-preview9\n        [2026-09-15] v0.7.0 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        2. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        3. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-09-16] v0.7.1 Dependency updates from Senparc.Xncf.KnowledgeBase to 0.7.3; Senparc.Web to 0.39.1\n        [2026-09-17] v0.7.2 Dependency updates from Senparc.Ncf.XncfBase to 0.28.0\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        2. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-10-01] v0.7.3 addcross-moduleprivateattachmentimportcapabilities\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        2. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-10-21] v0.8.0 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        2. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-10-24] Expose bounded document sections for Workspace attachments, preserve worksheet names/cell addresses and presentation order, and guard Office archive expansion.\n        [2026-11-03] v0.8.1 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-11-03] Add shared contextual documentation beside upload settings.\n        [2026-11-03] v0.8.3 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        2. Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.23.10\n        3. Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.DatabasePlant to 0.21.14\n        4. Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.Service to 0.23.11-preview10\n        5. Dependency update from Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase to 0.13.12\n        [2026-11-11] v0.8.3 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-11-12] v0.8.4 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        2. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-11-19] v0.8.5 Localized file management and upload surfaces\n        1. Updated localized labels, resource fallbacks, and user-facing messages across affected surfaces.\n        2. Kept runtime behavior and module integration aligned with the affected service and registration changes.",
